    + ' ' + 'REV .120 (2026-09-30, §17.3): the page-level Symbol box is gone; the page reads the top bar’s symbol (?symbol= first on entry, the held symbol carried in otherwise) and the toolbar shows the shared SymbolScopeChip in its place — “filtered to X ✕” / “Symbol ⌘K”, which opens the top bar search. The chip counts in Clear N; ✕, Clear N and the empty state’s reset clear the top bar symbol too (clearCarriedSymbol), not just this page. The filter is now a whole name, not a prefix (it was a prefix for typing). The filtered empty state leads with “Filtered to X (the top bar symbol)”.'
     + ' ' + 'REV .138 / .142 (2026-10-01, Package .52 full): a draft is edited in the inspector — its first section is the plan (Account as a segment of the two followed accounts, Contracts and each option leg\u2019s strike as DS NumberFields, the expiry as a date, the rationale) and every change writes back through PUT /plans/{id} 500ms after the last keystroke; no Save, no edit sheet (retired; the sheet is New only). ⌘Z (outside a field) undoes through the page\u2019s undo stack, a run of typing in one field merging into one step (1.5s); the toast\u2019s Undo and ⌘Z are one stack. Past draft the inspector says why in one line (intended frozen as written · lapsed · filled · cancelled) and the actions are the way out. Delete draft and ⌘⌫ delete with no confirm: the row leaves at once and DELETE /plans/{id} (api 0.1.9 / core 0.28.0, drafts only) goes when the toast leaves without Undo (Owner 2026-10-01: held delete). Mark intended is held the same way; what the server would refuse it for (no leg · no target, stop or exit-by) is said at once in its words and nothing is held. A new plan from the sheet is selected; hidden by the scope bar, the toast\u2019s action is Show (clears the scope, selects it), else a draft offers Undo, which deletes it. The toolbar carries the DS TokenSearchField — Symbol · Structure · Source · Plan · Contains (id, symbol, structure, rationale, source), union within a kind, intersection across, in the URL as ?q= and counted by Clear N. DIVERGED, named: the prototype\u2019s Cancel intent sends an intent back to draft; the store has no intended→draft move, so Cancel stays the existing held cancel (status cancelled), and the read-only line says to cancel and plan again. Save as list (Rev .139): with a scope set the toolbar offers Save as list, named by the page (tokens · symbol · account · status, e.g. AMD · all), kept server-side for the one operator (Owner 2026-10-01: preference_saved_search, core 0.28.0 / api 0.1.9); on a saved scope it is Remove list; both via the toast and ⌘Z. The sidebar lists Saved searches after the pins on every page; a click opens the page with that scope, and while the page\u2019s scope is exactly a saved one the sidebar lights that row instead of the page row.'
