    + ' ' + 'REV .112 (2026-09-29, from the retired Outcome): Record’s Cut is Play · Structure · **Source** · **Lens**, and /portfolio/outcome now lands on Source. Source rows are the server’s five values plus No plan, over closed trades (per trade, because a plan names a trade): n · Hit rate (a tally under 20) · Realised · Avg · Worst · vs backtest · Sample, each row opening the Queue. The design folds a plan-less trade into nothing; here it has its own row, since on DEV it is every trade. Lens has one row, no lens recorded, and vs backtest is — everywhere: nothing stores a lens or a run. By play gains **Earned from**, —, titled with why (needs the daily snapshot — computed on P&L Explain). The account toggle applies to the new cuts too.'
